{"@type": "WebPage", "author": {"name": "UNDP", "image": {"url": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQHXz6IjqSAuCA/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1693541095620?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Gv4ao6xfXDTG48AaYQt7RuzCH5Omw8CfEz7IdnH-hM0", "@type": "ImageObject"}, "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/undp", "@type": "Organization", "interactionStatistic": {"@type": "InteractionCounter", "interactionType": "http://schema.org/FollowAction", "userInteractionCount": 2971232}}, "headline": "Building better futures, together 🤝🏽.
 
Through collaboration and collective action, we have been working with partners for over 60 years to pave the way for a prosperous, sustainable planet🌎 for everyone, everywhere.
 
#UNGA #PartnersAtCore"}

{"@type": "WebPage", "author": {"name": "Green Climate Fund", "image": {"url": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C510BAQFJDNsxZHjtNQ/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1631419239988/green_climate_fund_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=LVWX_ETzW1Uj_guA2JkQD6V_bkQtDkH6pSAketgBw4Q", "@type": "ImageObject"}, "url": "https://kr.linkedin.com/company/green-climate-fund", "@type": "Organization", "interactionStatistic": {"@type": "InteractionCounter", "interactionType": "http://schema.org/FollowAction", "userInteractionCount": 425227}}, "headline": "In Bosnia and Herzegovina, GCF worked with UNDP in Bosnia and Herzegovina to scale up investments in energy efficiency retrofits for public buildings. 

The $123 million project used $17.3 million in GCF financing to help reduce emissions from more than 430 buildings across the country while improving conditions for the people who use them every day.

This #CleanAirDay, watch how this investment delivered clean air, healthier lives, and economic prosperity in the town of Foča 🇧🇦. #ClimateAction"}

{"@type": "WebPage", "author": {"name": "ESMAP - Energy Sector Management Assistance Program", "image": {"url": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQEVwmU9IlHuNA/company-logo_100_100/B4EZ_xvG.SK0AM-/0/1786467086453/esmap_energy_sector_management_assistance_program_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=ct-JqfRdKqnispfpJNcEfz5G8jE5gh10Mhc7Epru8hc", "@type": "ImageObject"}, "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/esmap-energy-sector-management-assistance-program", "@type": "Organization", "interactionStatistic": {"@type": "InteractionCounter", "interactionType": "http://schema.org/FollowAction", "userInteractionCount": 14521}}, "headline": "This week: Join us at "From Commitment to Implementation: A Global Dialogue on Coordinated UN-Energy Action for Clean Cooking," a side event within the 2026 United Nations High-Level Political Forum.

The event will explore how UN-Energy members and partners can better coordinate support to countries, including through existing tools and support mechanisms, opportunities for joint action, and practical next steps for strengthening collaboration at the global, regional, and country levels.

The event will be convened by UN-Energy, supported by the World Health Organization and The World Bank Group's ESMAP, in cooperation with Liberia, Uganda and the United Kingdom."}

{"@type": "WebPage", "author": {"name": "António Guterres", "image": {"url": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E03AQFlOM0cj6QpcQ/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/0/1678820023589?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=mrsk9qw2HfEoXtMRIRIAKYtj2t1YzYGZ_Iqhv05dBDA", "@type": "ImageObject"}, "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/antonio-guterres", "@type": "Person", "interactionStatistic": {"@type": "InteractionCounter", "interactionType": "http://schema.org/FollowAction", "userInteractionCount": 1214997}}, "headline": "From pushback to rollback, women’s human rights are under attack.

Instead of mainstreaming equal rights, we are seeing the mainstreaming of misogyny.

Together, let’s stand firm in making rights, equality and empowerment a reality for all women and girls, for everyone, everywhere."}

{"@type": "WebPage", "author": {"name": "Riad Meddeb", "image": {"url": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C5103AQG9sw02Vw5GAQ/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/0/1516239304664?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=XHzXiAvtB2oc4S_5p8foeQ7csNcNOh5JEyQ6pj75BN8", "@type": "ImageObject"}, "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/riadmeddeb", "@type": "Person", "interactionStatistic": {"@type": "InteractionCounter", "interactionType": "http://schema.org/FollowAction", "userInteractionCount": 17184}}, "headline": "At the #SIDS 🏝️ Ministerial of the International Renewable Energy Agency (IRENA)  Assembly, I shared the key levers identified in the upcoming SIDS #Energy Strategy soon to be released by @UNDP.

